# Backend base URL, baked into the bundle at build time.
#  - Local dev: leave unset; the Vite dev server proxies /api to the backend (port from start-backend.bat).
#  - Vercel:    set in Project Settings -> Environment Variables, e.g.
#               VITE_API_URL=https://ai-commander-api.up.railway.app
# This is a public URL, not a secret (it ends up in the browser bundle).
# VITE_API_URL=
